  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Mission Horticulture to Nigeria 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From 23 to 28 March 2025, a Horticulture Trade Mission to Nigeria will be organised, featuring an envisioned delegation of about 20 Dutch companies and institutes.The mission is organised to address several key factors and provide a unique opportunity to gain valuable insights into the Nigerian horticulture sector and explore business opportunities.The programme includes participation in the &apos;Agrofood Nigeria Lagos&apos; trade fair, with a booth in the Netherlands Pavilion, seminars, networking events, an Agropreneur Award, individual matchmaking, as well as field and business visits.</narrative>
  </description>
